# SCSS Conventions

- BEM with `app_` prefix: `.app_{block}__{element}`, `.app_{block}__{element}--{modifier}`.
- Component SCSS: `@use "../../../../styles/includes.scss" as *;` (adjust depth as needed).
- Nest with `&__` and `&--`; use project mixins (`flexCenter`, `transition`, breakpoints).
- Colors/fonts: use variables from `styles/abstracts/variables/`, not hardcoded values in new code.
- Icon fonts: `webfont webfont-{name}` classes alongside accessible labels in HTML.
- Global utilities: `.sr_only`, `.hidden` in `styles/base/_global.scss`.
